cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Decoy buffering of intensive and extensive noise: simulation code"
abstract: >-
  Stochastic models of transcription-factor binding to nonspecific decoy
  sites: an exact adiabatic master-equation solver, an exact stochastic
  simulation with explicit binding, and an age-structured cycling-cell
  simulation with genome replication. Reproduces all figures and reported
  numbers of the accompanying paper.
